  "scope": "Every record the d2409ccd0 rerun compared, 124 records, their variants regenerated from each record's generator and compared again after moving the reference pin from d2409ccd0 to b477c1574 (the fork's patches 131 to 134; the community base and client 70338 did not move, the Go database took patch 134's 13 item edits). All 14,341 variants were compared: 14,278 match Go, Rust refuses 63 and none differ, the counts of the d2409ccd0 rerun record by record, the same 63 refused for the same reasons: 51 of the 57 refusals the rotation unit and tank records list and the 12 Mage census presets that read unitDistance and run prepull actions.",
