  "retries": "no export, Go run or Rust run failed or timed out. Two variants of the 2026-10-04 shadow-priest-shadowfiend race sweep (sweep-02 and sweep-23) differed at first: the Shadowfiend was still out at the fight's end, and Rust logged its dismissal with Mana Spring Totem's MP5, which Go's doneIteration has expired by then. Commit f7f2d0558 fixed it (fight_end_stats), and the 15 chunks holding a Priest request that had run before it ran again after it, all of their variants matching; the fix touches only the Shadowfiend's exporter effect and summon, so no other chunk ran twice",
